nce, which sharpens your natural inclinations to get out of the way of incoming harm; or the elixir of precision, which grants intuitive understanding of an enemy's most sensitive spots. Which would you like to aid me with?","source_tag":"_t","target":"太好了。那么，我目前正在研制三种药剂。我每次只交给你一项，毕竟我曾吃过苦头，深知让冒险者的大脑负荷过重有多危险。以下是你的选择：狡诈药剂，能让你如狐狸般敏捷狡黠；闪避药剂，能磨砺你躲避来袭伤害的本能；或是精准药剂，能让你凭直觉洞悉敌人最脆弱的要害。你想协助我制作哪一种？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dfa8239ac91c49a75ce993be1ead252407ce2331ad47563d35d16bede1814dd3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bb059e37514ba5cc19a942c31bad0de6deeb9b2603f666c8b3985f4feedf4628","logical_entry_identity":"c3de1b1de0759ddf2fceb5f03245b9bc007ed5f7651fb715c15f65fab2136a15","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Grim Shadow","source_tag":"talent name","target":"冷酷阴影"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4d4cc633be8f4bba7d045a01dc526f17beab2ca9488c0ab0371c054b30380ff1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bb094d0305f13bd186a95402393d445cdbfbf04b6d1235c6ac6ea094f12689a6","logical_entry_identity":"200a0c2937ce572c1d39ec7f48b5e9613c6322f40ce6b6dfc0153fb32f5bb40b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"stone","source_tag":"talent type","target":"石"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6d9a5943839006edc188a6c823357c3245e676efbb0d5fda526f8590f668360f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bb095f72a07e8bc1abf4b5605e2743c5c2e1445040565e49e4107ca6cac31aa4","logical_entry_identity":"4aecec0e39b843457087aa3c0a2350de5cfc0c0ab46f5b3e656acdf2058f5e35","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_RED#EXTERMINATE THIS FOE#LAST#\n%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#LIGHT_RED#歼灭这个敌人#LAST#\n%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8e12391aa2a2c5692ccf3a3bce0d7e0c334a10843e1bf713d70f79982777bc23","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bb0aa211ac3ed7f82957d50ca8dc2ee0baa8b0549df50fad42a0713c6a8cf145","logical_entry_identity":"060ae24ff908c1def08943a77bf3dc71ba49c4d2b2312afb30e2fe4d04000e50","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Object